{
  "name": "Power Word Pain",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> A creature within 60 ft takes 6d8 Force damage. If it had 100 Hit Points or fewer, it's also Charmed for the duration: its Speed can be no more than 10 ft, it has Disadvantage on D20 Tests except Constitution saves, and when it tries to cast a spell it makes a CON save first or the spell fails (the slot isn't spent). It makes a CON save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on a success.</p>",
